SbpIrcatMg2EKSaAdOkQg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOdX-i54YIAESj6BnEUxiGX3BW5fd9cZ5UTN9959l1VGw&oe=6AC3D3ED"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-image-scaled-down-BG-move-cleaner.png", "id": "1387874676313489", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1387874679646822_7321874149456102296_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lcqbOdU0uCcQ7kNvwE_AFp9&_nc_oc=AdrF8zxJ9K73Oa7MrbUajQMlzx5Bl1RQ6aQFLlAngJ1eDMX_QVwktrfL52HsJ9y-CNY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPZxFVqiBShr3r4_Rq8kGquJ5XCuGKp13gwyRaFEt52jg&oe=6AC3D242"}, "display_name": "PullFit", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# PullFit\n**Resistance bands required**\n\nPullFit is a mixed reality fitness app built specifically for resistance bands, using hand tracking so your hands stay free to train.\n\nBuild strength with structured workouts, fitness tests and progressive training plans - all from your own home.\n\nWhether you're just getting started or already train regularly, PullFit helps you stay consistent with guided workouts that fit around your day.\n\n\n# FEATURES\n\u2022 Real resistance band workouts\n\n\u2022 Beginner, Intermediate and Advanced training plans\n\n\u2022 Full-body strength training\n\n\u2022 Fitness testing and progress tracking\n\n\u2022 Training Mirror\n\n\u2022 Individual exercise practice mode\n\n\u2022 Multiple user profiles\n\n\u2022 Hand tracking controls - no controllers required\n\n\u2022 Mixed reality workouts in your own space\n\n\u2022 Cloud saves\n\n\n# TRAIN SMARTER\nBuild streaks, track workout history and monitor your fitness test results as you progress through your training journey.\n\n\n# TRAIN ANYWHERE\nNo gym membership. No bulky equipment. Just your headset, a resistance band and a little space to move.", "short_description": "Build real strength in mixed reality using resistance bands, guided workouts and progressive tr